<title>UK: Adecco sets 300 mln Sfr eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Adecco sets 300 mln Sfr eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ADECCO SA</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.00	MATURITY    07.JUL.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.55    PAY DATE    07.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   20.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
